@startuml
title Himeros — Browser Authentication
autonumber
actor Member
participant "Angular" as Web
participant "Auth API" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Member -> Web : submit credentials
Web -> API : POST /auth/web/login
API -> DB : verify user/password
API -> DB : persist hash(refresh token)
API --> Web : access token JSON\nSet-Cookie refresh HttpOnly
note right of Web
Access token: memory only
Refresh token: inaccessible to JS
end note

Web -> API : GET protected resource\nBearer access token
API --> Web : 200

... access token expires ...
Web -> API : protected request
API --> Web : 401
Web -> API : POST /auth/web/refresh\nHttpOnly cookie automatically sent
API -> DB : validate + revoke/rotate old refresh
API --> Web : new access token\nSet-Cookie new refresh
Web -> API : retry original request
@enduml
